SUMMARY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Implemented the DLQ Inspector as an adaptive SwiftUI surface (macOS regular /
iPad regular / iPhone compact, ADR-002/006), driven by an @Observable model over
a KMP-style data-source seam (ADR-004 — zero networking in the view). Reproduces
the full web page: the title/subtitle chrome, the dismissible replay-blocked
banner, the status header (3 stat tiles + the env-gate banner), the two web
GlassPanels (dead-letter entries + recent replay activity), the inspect drawer
(summary KVList + decoded payload tabs + copy + replay CTA), and the replay
confirmation stacked on the drawer. Every visible string resolves from
Localizable.xcstrings with the web key names; SI N/A (DLQ envelope metadata
carries no units — only exact byte counts + timestamps formatted at the boundary).

