 the Replayable Yes/No badge + Inspect action, the 7-column AuditPanel with the
 result-coded badge, and the EntryDrawer's 8-field KVList + inner/raw payload tabs
 + CopyButton + the env/replayable/in-flight-gated Replay CTA. +40 more web keys
