DATA SOURCES (bound through the @Observable model; web hook names kept at call sites)
  useDLQList   -> DLQInspectorDataSource.loadList()  (GET /system/dlq)
  useDLQEntry  -> DLQInspectorDataSource.loadEntry(id:)  (GET /system/dlq/{numericId})
  useDLQAudit  -> DLQInspectorDataSource.loadAudit(limit:)  (GET /system/dlq/audit, limit=50)
  useDLQReplay -> DLQInspectorDataSource.replay(id:)  (POST /system/dlq/{id}/replay)
  Failure split reproduced: result=="disabled" (soft flag) AND DLQReplayDisabledError
  (HTTP-403 env gate) both raise the persistent banner; result=="ok" closes the drawer;
  any other failure keeps the confirm open for retry (web mutation-toast branch).

